WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.392
Scheduled Castes,

2
00:00:01.392 --> 00:00:02.534
Scheduled Tribes,

3
00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:04.715
and Backward Classes each have

4
00:00:04.715 --> 00:00:06.103
a national commission,

5
00:00:06.103 --> 00:00:07.794
in the Constitution.

6
00:00:08.151 --> 00:00:11.083
The commission for Scheduled Castes

7
00:00:11.083 --> 00:00:13.175
is under Article 338.

8
00:00:13.175 --> 00:00:15.849
The tribes got their own

9
00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.135
under 338A in 2003,

10
00:00:18.135 --> 00:00:21.198
and the backward classes got

11
00:00:21.198 --> 00:00:23.165
338B in 2018.

12
00:00:23.508 --> 00:00:25.502
The eighty-ninth amendment split off

13
00:00:25.502 --> 00:00:27.059
the tribal commission.

14
00:00:27.059 --> 00:00:29.501
The hundred-and-second gave the backward

15
00:00:29.501 --> 00:00:32.596
classes commission constitutional status.

16
00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:33.734
By contrast,

17
00:00:33.734 --> 00:00:35.417
the women's commission and the

18
00:00:35.417 --> 00:00:38.165
human rights commission are statutory

19
00:00:38.165 --> 00:00:39.265
bodies.

20
00:00:39.959 --> 00:00:41.185
Your turn.

21
00:00:41.185 --> 00:00:42.960
Which amendment?
